{"version":1,"slug":"removable-pros","title_fa":"پروتز متحرک","subtopics":[{"slug":"implant-overdentures","title_fa":"اوردنچرِ متکی بر ایمپلنت","count":10},{"slug":"complete-dentures","title_fa":"دنچر کامل","count":3},{"slug":"snap-on-smile","title_fa":"اسنپ‌آن اسمایل","count":4}],"cards_html":"  <details class=\"pillar-card\" data-subtopic=\"implant-overdentures\">\n    <summary class=\"pillar-card-summary\">\n      <span class=\"pillar-card-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.5 3.5h5v3.5h-5z\"/> <path d=\"M8 7h8l-2 12-2 2-2-2z\"/> <path d=\"M9.3 11h5.4\"/> <path d=\"M9.7 14.5h4.6\"/> <path d=\"M10.4 18h3.2\"/></svg></span>\n      <h2 class=\"pillar-card-title\">اوردنچرِ متکی بر ایمپلنت</h2>\n      <span class=\"pillar-card-count\" aria-label=\"۱۰ مورد\">(۱۰)</span>\n      <span class=\"pillar-card-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\">▾</span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"pillar-card-body\">\n      <p class=\"pillar-subtopic-intro\">دنچری که چند ایمپلنت آن را مهار می‌کنند. قلبِ تصمیم این‌جا <strong>اتچمنت</strong> است — بار در برابر لوکیتور، تعداد ایمپلنت، و پروتکلِ بارگذاری — و این‌که چگونه گیر و پایداری با راحتی و بهداشتِ بیمار متعادل شود.</p>\n      <ul class=\"pillar-list\">\n      <li class=\"pillar-item\" data-type=\"glossary\">\n        <a href=\"/glossary/overdenture.html\" class=\"pillar-item-link\">\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20\"/> <path d=\"M4 4.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5z\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-title\">Overdenture</span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\"> گلاسری</span>\n        </a>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"pillar-item\" data-type=\"chairside\">\n        <a href=\"/chairside/chairside-11.html\" class=\"pillar-item-link\">\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 9V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3\"/> <path d=\"M3 11v5a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-5a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v2H7v-2a2 2 0 0 0-4 0z\"/> <path d=\"M5 18v2\"/> <path d=\"M19 18v2\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-title\">نبود اکلوژن خلفی؛ مانعی پنهان برای اوردنچر فک بالا</span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\"> چِرساید</span>\n        </a>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"pillar-item\" data-type=\"podcast\">\n        <a href=\"/episodes/episode-147-6.html\" class=\"pillar-item-link\">\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 14a9 9 0 0 1 18 0\"/> <path d=\"M5 14h3v7H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z\"/> <path d=\"M19 14h-3v7h3a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-title\">دنتوپدیا — صفر تا صد اوردنچرها</span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\"> پادکست</span>\n        </a>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"pillar-item\" data-type=\"podcast\">\n        <a href=\"/episodes/episode-27.html\" class=\"pillar-item-link\">\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 14a9 9 0 0 1 18 0\"/> <path d=\"M5 14h3v7H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z\"/> <path d=\"M19 14h-3v7h3a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"/></svg></span>\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-title\">مقایسهٔ اتچمنت‌ها در اوردنچر</span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\"> پادکست</span>\n        </a>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"pillar-item\" data-type=\"podcast\">\n        <a href=\"/episodes/episode-50.html\" class=\"pillar-item-link\">\n          <span class=\"pillar-item-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"dc-svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 14a9 9 0 0 1 18 0\"/> <path d=\"M5 14h3v7H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3a2 2 0